            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Updates now ask you right in Focus.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.3</h2>
<ul>
  <li>When a new version of Jarvis has downloaded, Focus shows a small
      “New version” card. Press Restart to update and Jarvis reopens on the
      new version; press Later and it asks again tomorrow. It never shows
      while a meeting is recording, and quitting Jarvis still installs the
      update as before.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
